{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xhdcw8cuPLS7HNUTZVs8La","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 34\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 01:05 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 方案：dreamerv3-torch + DMC Walker Walk 验证事件门控可行性\\\\n  rationale: 选择 NM512/dreamerv3-torch 作为代码基础（干净 RSSM 实现，方便修改），DMC Walker Walk 作为验证任务（DreamerV3\\\\n    标准基准，快速迭代）。MVP 只验证技术可行性（gate 不坍缩、训练收敛、有效跳步），不验证完整研究假设（长时域信用分配改善需要 ManiSkill3 等长时域任务，留到\\\\n    research 阶段）。Reviewer 主要担忧 impact(3/5) 源于评估任务时长不够长（250 步 StackPyramid 可能只显示中等收益），但这是\\\\n    research 阶段的问题，不影响 MVP 方案。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 01:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 建议：量化 MVP criterion 4 + 补充 kill criteria\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer warning 两点均合理：(1) criterion 4 原为定性描述，改为 Δt 序列自相关 > 0.15 OR 标准差\\\\n    > 0.5，可判定；(2) 补充 kill criteria：MVP GPU 上限 15h，训练发散最多重试 2 次，gate 坍缩则尝试 soft attention\\\\n    mixture fallback，15h 耗尽未过则报告用户决定 kill/pivot。Info 项（entropy 阈值宽松、Walker Walk 缺相位结构、代码基础选择）均\\\\n    acknowledged，MVP 阶段不需要额外动作。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 04:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 部署 subsample curriculum 补丁，重启 event-gated 实验 (exp_002→exp_003)\\\\n  rationale: Phase 1 (0-50K) 中 subsample_variable_dt 不应生效但生效了，导致 RSSM 训练数据与 imagination\\\\n    Δt=1 不匹配，event-gated return 仅 40% baseline。这是设计缺陷，不是超参问题。44K 步的污染权重不可恢复，需干净重跑。补丁让子采样跟随\\\\n    gate curriculum：Phase 1 纯 Δt=1，Phase 2 渐进增大，Phase 3 完整 log-uniform。损失 ~1.7h GPU\\\\n    时间（cuda:1），在 15 GPU·h MVP 预算内。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_event_gated\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: return 40% baseline due to Phase 1 subsample mismatch\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 09:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 中期评估：3/4 标准已过（gate 有效），criterion 1 (return) 是风险点，设 150K/200K checkpoint\\\\n    评估 + pivot 方案\\\\n  rationale: 'Step 96K 数据：entropy=1.54>0.3, H_eff=35.7>18, dt_std=1.30>0.5，gate 机制功能验证通过。但\\\\n    return ratio=36.5%（需≥80%），Phase 2 进行 46K 步无恢复趋势。Reviewer 估计 criterion 1 通过概率 15-25%。Plan:\\\\n    Phase 3 稳定后（150K/200K）评估，ratio<50% 则 pivot 到 K=4 + 延长 curriculum。3/4 已过说明 gate\\\\n    机制本身有价值，return 问题可能是 K 太大或 ramp 太快的调参问题。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_event_gated_v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: gate mechanism works (3/4 criteria pass) but return degrades to 36.5%\\\\n      baseline at step 96K\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 10:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: Return 崩塌根因确认：imagination dt 无约束导致 OOD。修复方案 C（logits masking + clamp），从头重跑\\\\n    exp_004\\\\n  rationale: Agent 代码审查确认 _imagine 中 gate 自由输出 dt∈{1,...,8}，而 world model 训练数据受 subsample\\\\n    curriculum 限制（gate_scale=0.5 时仅见过 dt≤4）。未训练的 dt embedding → RSSM 噪声预测 → reward\\\\n    head 垃圾输出 → actor/critic progressive poisoning → return 从 37% 崩到 10%。修复方案 C：(1)\\\\n    Gate logits masking（dt > effective_max_dt 的 logits 设 -inf）做 soft constraint，(2)\\\\n    torch.clamp 做 hard safety net。不做 checkpoint 恢复（baseline RSSM 架构不含 dt_embedding），从头干净重跑。保持\\\\n    K=8 + 原 curriculum 参数，先验证 bug fix 是否足够恢复 return，若不够再 pivot K=4。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_event_gated_v2\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: return catastrophically collapsed to 10% at step 105K due to unconstrained\\\\n      imagination dt\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 10:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 追加修复：_compute_target dt 索引错位 2 位，与 imagination dt clipping 并行修复后重跑 exp_004\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 _compute_target 将 dts[1:] 传入 lambda_return_variable_dt，但\\\\n    dts[t] 是 gate 在 succ_t 处为下一步转移决定的 dt，不是当前步转移 dt。正确序列应为 [init_dt=1, dts[0], ...,\\\\n    dts[H-3]]，实际是 [dts[1], dts[2], ..., dts[H-1]]，每位偏移 2。Phase 1 全 dt=1 不受影响，Phase\\\\n    2+ dt 方差越大错误越严重——完美解释 gate_scale 与 return 的负相关。此 bug 比 imagination dt 无约束更致命：即使\\\\n    imagination dt 被 clip，λ-return 索引错误仍会污染 actor/critic 训练信号。两个 bug 必须同时修复。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_event_gated_v2\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: dt index misalignment in _compute_target caused progressive λ-return corruption\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 11:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 停止 Walker Walk baseline（已收敛），启动 Cheetah Run baseline 为多环境泛化铺路\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 压力测试结论：单环境（Walker Walk）即使 MVP 全 PASS 也只够 workshop paper，A 类（CoRL\\\\n    DDL 5/29）需要 4-6 个 DMC 环境 + 多 seed + ablation。Walker Walk baseline 已在 ~920 eval_return\\\\n    稳定超过 100K 步，不需要继续跑到 500K。cuda:0 应立即用于铺 Cheetah Run baseline——无论 exp_004 成功（需要多环境验证泛化）还是失败（K=4\\\\n    pivot 也需要多环境），Cheetah baseline 都是必须的。同时 Cheetah Run 是 DreamerV3 标准基准之一，episode\\\\n    结构不同于 Walker Walk，能测试 gate 在不同运动模式下的行为。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_baseline\\\\n    role: completed\\\\n    result: Walker Walk baseline converged at ~920 eval_return\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 15:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill exp_004：gate_loss 爆炸 bug（compute_gate_targets 用 gate_max_dt 而非 effective_max_dt），第三次\\\\n    train/imagine distribution mismatch，需全量审计后重启 exp_005\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 gate_loss 从 0 跳到 2.84e8（正常值 ~5），根因：compute_gate_targets 生成\\\\n    8-bin target 分布但 logits masking 只保留 effective_max_dt 个 bin，cross-entropy 在 masked\\\\n    bin 上产生 ~3e8 loss。eval_return@125K=352（baseline 37%）。这是第三次同类 bug（exp_002 subsample/exp_003\\\\n    imagination dt + λ-return/exp_004 gate target vs masking），需要对 gate_max_dt vs effective_max_dt\\\\n    做全量代码审计后再重启。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_004_event_gated_v3\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: negative - gate_loss explosion 2.84e8, return 37% baseline\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_event_gated_v2\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: negative - same bug class\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_event_gated\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: failed - same bug class\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 21:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: Hard Gumbel gate 结构性失败确认，启动 exp_006 fixed dt=2 诊断实验\\\\n  rationale: exp_003/004/005 三次实验均在 gate_scale>0.5 时发生 return 崩塌。exp_005 是首次在所有 bug\\\\n    修复 + gate_loss 正常(0.53) + gate 行为健康(entropy 1.54, dt_mean 2.44)条件下的崩塌，排除了实现 bug\\\\n    的可能。结论：hard Gumbel gate + variable-rate imagination 与 actor-critic 优化存在结构性冲突。exp_006\\\\n    fixed dt=2 是关键分叉诊断——如果 fixed dt=2 正常则问题在 learned gate 动态选择，如果也崩则问题在 variable-rate\\\\n    imagination 本身。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_event_gated_v4\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: return 崩塌 276→25.7 at gate_scale 0.5→0.6\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_004_event_gated_v3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative - 崩塌模式相同\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_event_gated_v2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative - 崩塌模式相同\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n    result: 已审批待启动\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 21:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: Pivot 决策树调整：exp_006 正常分支下，K=2 binary hard gate 优先于 soft weighted gate\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出两点：(1) A1 soft weighted gate 每步需 K 次 RSSM forward pass，K=8\\\\n    时 8 倍计算开销，与时间抽象节省计算的初衷矛盾；(2) 遗漏了最简诊断方案——K=2 binary hard gate (dt∈{1,2})，保持 hard\\\\n    gate 计算效率，仅缩小离散空间和梯度方差。这能区分\\\\\\\"hard gate 本身有问题\\\\\\\"还是\\\\\\\"只是 K 太大\\\\\\\"。工程量极低（改 gate_max_dt=2）。新决策树：exp_006\\\\n    正常 → 先试 K=2 binary hard gate → 若成功则增量扩 K → 若仍失败再考虑 soft 方案。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_event_gated_v4\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: return collapsed to 47.4\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 22:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: 修正 D010 pivot 方案：K=2 实现应用 Bernoulli straight-through 或 sigmoid relaxation，而非\\\\n    K=2 Gumbel-Softmax\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 K=2 Gumbel-Softmax 本质仍是 hard categorical gate（与 exp_003-005\\\\n    失败机制相同，只是方差更小），与 memory.md \\\\\\\"不要再尝试 hard categorical gate\\\\\\\" 矛盾。真正的 binary gate 应使用不同梯度估计器：(a)\\\\n    Bernoulli straight-through estimator（离散但梯度路径不同）或 (b) continuous sigmoid relaxation（连续化，彻底避免离散决策）。等\\\\n    exp_006/007 诊断结果出后，若走\\\\\\\"gate 是问题\\\\\\\"分支，优先尝试 Bernoulli ST，次选 sigmoid soft gate。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_fixed_dt4\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_event_gated_v4\\\\n    role: evidence_negative\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: 三档 claim 结构确认 + 单 GPU 多实验并行策略 + exp_006 叙事修正\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 深度分析修正了两个关键判断：(1) exp_006@45K 回到 93% baseline，\\\\\\\"超基线 25%\\\\\\\" 是 35K\\\\n    处 baseline 临时回调造成的假象，正确表述是\\\\\\\"跟踪基线 ±10%\\\\\\\"——仍是正向信号（证明 dt=2 不伤害训练），但 claim 不能说\\\\\\\"超越\\\\\\\"。(2)\\\\n    三档 claim 结构：A 档（仅诊断发现，workshop 级）、B 档（Bernoulli ST 成功=方法贡献，CoRL 可投）、C 档（learned\\\\n    gate > fixed dt=最强 CoRL 投稿）。当前距 B 档缺 Bernoulli ST 实验，距 C 档缺 Bernoulli ST + learned>fixed\\\\n    两步。Bernoulli ST 是最高优先级实验。另外 Reviewer 发现 GPU 仅占 4GB/96GB，单 GPU 可并行 3-4 个实验，吞吐量可提升\\\\n    3-4×，对赶 CoRL DDL 意义重大。所有实验当前 seed=1，CoRL 最低要求 3 seeds。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 35K=485.3(125% baseline), 45K=477.0(93% baseline), tracking baseline ±10%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_fixed_dt4\\\\n    role: evidence_negative\\\\n    result: 35K=126.7(33% baseline), declining trend\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_event_gated_v4\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: Gumbel gate structural failure confirmed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: dt=4 失败根因定位：actor-critic credit assignment 崩塌，非 RSSM 预测能力不足\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立分析 3-way metrics 发现：(1) exp_007 model_loss 与 baseline/dt=2\\\\n    相当（4.75 vs 4.12 vs 5.23@35K），排除 RSSM 预测能力瓶颈假说；(2) actor_loss@35K 从正常的 -0.577(baseline)/-0.331(dt=2)\\\\n    崩塌到 -0.015(dt=4)，actor 完全停止学习；(3) actor_entropy 从 -2.42@25K 跳到 +1.54@35K，策略退化为随机；(4)\\\\n    value_mean 仅 25.9（baseline 207.8 的 12.5%），critic 严重低估。因果链明确：dt=4 粗粒度 lambda-return\\\\n    → credit assignment 困难 → critic 崩 → actor 失去信号 → 策略崩溃。这个发现对论文有三重价值：(a) 否定了简单的\\\\\\\"模型能力不足\\\\\\\"解释，将问题精确定位在\\\\n    imagination-to-policy interface；(b) 为 dt∈{1,2} sweet spot 提供因果解释而非仅经验观察；(c) 强化\\\\n    Bernoulli ST gate (dt∈{1,2}) 的设计动机。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_fixed_dt4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: actor_loss→0, entropy→random, value 12.5% baseline @35K, model_loss normal\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: actor_loss=-0.331, healthy training @35K\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_baseline\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: actor_loss=-0.577, reference @35K\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:45 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp_006 55K 跌至 58% baseline，诊断结论更新为\\\\\\\"最优 dt 随训练阶段变化\\\\\\\"；批准 exp_008 Bernoulli\\\\n    ST 立即启动\\\\n  rationale: exp_006 (fixed dt=2) 完整轨迹显示早期加速（15K-35K 超 baseline 67%）但后期衰退（55K 跌至 58%\\\\n    baseline），不符合原假设的场景 A（稳定）也非场景 B（全程有害）。Agent 提出场景 C：最优 dt 是训练阶段的函数——早期 dt=2 加速探索，后期需要细粒度控制。这比\\\\n    A/B 更强地论证了 learned adaptive gate 的必要性。但目前仅单 seed 数据，不能完全排除噪声/过拟合等替代解释。无论如何 Bernoulli\\\\n    ST (dt∈{1,2}) 是下一步必做实验：如果 gate 学会\\\\\\\"早期多 skip 晚期少 skip\\\\\\\"且 return ≥80% baseline，直接验证\\\\n    Scenario C + 达到 B 档 claim。cuda:1 空闲 >3h，立即批准 exp_008。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 早期+67% baseline, 55K跌至58%, 训练阶段依赖性\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_fixed_dt4\\\\n    role: evidence_negative\\\\n    result: 全程~30% baseline, 已关闭\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008_bernoulli_st\\\\n    role: approved\\\\n    result: 待启动 cuda:1\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp_006 65K 崩塌至 21.6% baseline，所有 dt>1 变体均失败；疑似 subsample curriculum 分布偏移是共同根因，设计无\\\\n    curriculum 对照实验\\\\n  rationale: exp_006 (fixed dt=2) 从 35K=485.3 崩至 65K=132.9 (21.6% baseline)，推翻了\\\\\\\"fixed\\\\n    dt 没问题、问题在 gate\\\\\\\"的诊断假设。Reviewer 指出关键洞察：崩塌窗口 35K-65K 与 subsample_variable_dt curriculum\\\\n    ramp (25K→75K) 精确重叠。即使 fixed_dt 模式，subsample 仍受 curriculum 控制——0-25K 训练数据纯 dt=1\\\\n    但 imagination 用 dt=2，25K-75K 分布剧变。这与 exp_002 的 Phase 1 mismatch 失败模式高度一致。所有 4\\\\n    个 dt>1 实验（exp_003-007）的崩塌都可能由同一根因解释：train/imagine 分布不匹配被 curriculum 延迟暴露。在排除 curriculum\\\\n    混淆因素前，讨论 gate 类型无意义。暂缓 Bernoulli ST (exp_008)，先做无 curriculum 对照：fixed dt=2 + subsample\\\\n    从头用 dt∈{1,2}（无 ramp）+ dt=2 imagination，消除分布偏移。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 65K=132.9 (21.6% baseline), collapsed\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_event_gated_v4\\\\n    role: pattern\\\\n    result: similar collapse window 55K-85K\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_event_gated\\\\n    role: pattern\\\\n    result: Phase 1 subsample mismatch, same root cause class\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: D015 curriculum 假设被代码审查推翻；exp_009 改为纯 dt=2 训练+想象（消除 train/imagine 分布偏移），并行分析\\\\n    exp_006 崩塌机制\\\\n  rationale: Agent 代码审查（commit 6159e46）确认：fixed_dt 模式下 curriculum 完全不生效，subsample\\\\n    从 step 0 就用 dt∈{1,2}（58.5%/41.5%），imagination 纯 dt=2。D015/Reviewer 的 curriculum-induced\\\\n    distribution shift 假设不成立。实际分布偏移是常量性的：训练 58.5% dt=1 + 41.5% dt=2，imagination 100%\\\\n    dt=2。exp_009 改为方案 A：subsample min_dt=2（纯 dt=2 训练），imagination dt=2，消除 train/imagine\\\\n    分布偏移。如果稳定→train/imagine 不匹配是根因→所有实验需要匹配训练分布；如果也崩→dt=2 imagination 在 DreamerV3\\\\n    中根本不可行。同时并行分析 exp_006 的 reward/value/policy/actor_loss 详细指标定位崩塌机制。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 65K=132.9, collapsed, curriculum NOT the cause\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009_no_curriculum\\\\n    role: redesigned\\\\n    result: 改为纯 dt=2 train+imagine 对照\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: Reviewer 代码审计证实 curriculum 在 fixed_dt 模式完全不执行；采用 2x2 析因隔离实验设计（exp_008a/008b）替代\\\\n    D016 方案，kill exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n  rationale: '代码 models.py:202-206 显示 gate_fixed_dt>0 时 gate_scale=0.0、effective_max_dt\\\\n    从 step 0 即为固定值，curriculum 完全不参与。D016 基于 curriculum 推翻后的初步分析，Reviewer 代码审计给出更精确的三假说（A:\\\\n    dt=2 imagination lambda-return 偏差 / B: subsample_variable_dt 干扰 / C: dt_embedding\\\\n    质量）和更优隔离设计。2x2 析因：exp_008a(no subsample + dt=2 imag) vs exp_008b(subsample + dt=1\\\\n    imag) 可在 2 GPU 并行 1 轮实验内完全区分根因。exp_006_fixed_dt2 已 132.9@65K (21.6% baseline)\\\\n    确认 negative，继续运行浪费 GPU。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: negative (132.9@65K, 21.6% baseline)\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: 'isolation: no subsample + dt=2 imagination'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008b\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: 'isolation: subsample + dt=1 imagination'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp_008b 替换为 exp_008c (dt=2, H=8)：隔离 compounding error 假说\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立分析指出：崩塌速度与 dt 完美正相关（dt=4@35K, dt=2@65K, dt=1 不崩），根因可能是 imagination\\\\n    物理时间覆盖过长（H×dt）导致 compounding error，而非 train/imagine 分布不匹配。原 exp_008b（subsample\\\\n    ON + dt=1 imagine）诊断价值低——dt=1 imagination 安全是 trivially true。替换为 exp_008c（dt=2\\\\n    imagine + H=8，物理覆盖≈16步≈baseline 的 15 步）能直接区分\\\\\\\"dt=2 本身有害\\\\\\\"vs\\\\\\\"物理覆盖过长有害\\\\\\\"。若 008a 崩+008c\\\\n    不崩→compounding error 是根因，解法是 H∝1/dt；若都崩→dt=2 RSSM 预测质量本身不足。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a\\\\n    role: 控制组\\\\n    result: 准备中\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c\\\\n    role: 替换 exp_008b\\\\n    result: 准备中\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: 崩塌分析来源\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_fixed_dt4\\\\n    role: 崩塌速度对比\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: Compounding error 假说被 exp_008c 数据反驳；Narrative B（Diagnostic Analysis）确认为最强路径\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 用 eval_return 数据纠正了我对 008c 的误读。核心矛盾：compounding error 假说预测 H=8\\\\n    应优于 H=15（更短 horizon = 更少误差累积），但 eval 数据显示 008c(H=8)@35K=185.1 远劣于 008a(H=15)@35K=500.8。根因是\\\\n    learning signal reduction：H=8 只提供 7 个 imagination step 的梯度信号，lambda-return 积累更少（target=41.2\\\\n    vs 81.5@35K）。此外 008a@35K=500.8 与 exp_006@35K=485.3 惊人相似——exp_006 后续崩塌至 133@65K。dt_embedding\\\\n    混淆未消除（两个实验的 dt_embedding[1] 均未训练），008d 是唯一能消除此混淆的实验。三条 Narrative 排序：B（诊断分析）★★★★\\\\n    > C（诊断+fix 混合）★★★ > A（自适应 horizon 方法论）★★。B 利用全部 11 个实验的失败模式作为诊断证据，任何 008 结果都加分；A\\\\n    的核心 claim 被当前数据反驳。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8\\\\n    role: 反驳 compounding error 假说\\\\n    result: H=8 eval 远劣于 H=15，与假说预测相反\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a_no_subsample_dt2\\\\n    role: 参照组\\\\n    result: '@35K=500.8 但轨迹类似 exp_006 崩塌前'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: 消除 dt_embedding 混淆\\\\n    result: 仅到 15K，待完成\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: 崩塌参照\\\\n    result: '@35K=485.3 后崩塌至 133@65K'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: 因果机制修正：exp_006 崩塌根因是 \\\\\\\"精确 imagination → delusional critic\\\\\\\"，非 \\\\\\\"subsample\\\\n    有毒\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 通过 value/eval 比率分析发现：exp_006 的 value/eval 以 20pp/10K 速度逼近并突破\\\\n    100%（45K=53.3%, 55K=93.3%, 65K=272%），而 008a 仅 23.4%@45K。两者差异核心是 dt_embedding 是否训练——训练后\\\\n    RSSM 精确预测 dt=2 → imagination 产生高 return → value 快速追上 → advantage 枯竭 → 崩塌。未训练的\\\\n    dt_embedding 意外充当悲观 imagination 偏置，阻止 value 过估。这改变了 BernoulliST 设计方向：需要引入 value\\\\n    pessimism 机制或利用 untrained embedding 作为内置悲观偏置。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006\\\\n    role: evidence_崩塌案例\\\\n    result: peak@35K=485.3 then collapse to 132.9@65K, value/eval突破272%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a\\\\n    role: evidence_对照组\\\\n    result: '@45K=563.4仍上升, value/eval仅23.4%, 未训练dt_embedding充当悲观偏置'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c\\\\n    role: evidence_H不足\\\\n    result: H=8 learning signal不足, 非compounding error\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: Delusional critic 因果链闭合：008c vs 008d controlled experiment 直接证明 trained\\\\n    dt_embedding 是 value 过估根因\\\\n  rationale: '008d (subsample ON=dt_emb trained, H=8) @35K: eval=146.3, value/eval=41.2%。008c\\\\n    (subsample OFF=dt_emb untrained, H=8) @35K: eval=185.1, value/eval~19%。同 H 同 dt\\\\n    唯一差异是 dt_emb 训练状态，value 过估翻倍以上。008d@35K 的 41.2% 与 exp_006@35K 的 ~43% 几乎相同，证明无论\\\\n    H=8/H=15，trained dt_emb 在 35K 就产生同等程度 value 过估。因果链：trained dt_emb → RSSM 精确预测\\\\n    dt=2 → optimistic imagination → value overestimation → advantage exhaustion →\\\\n    collapse。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: direct_evidence\\\\n    result: eval=146.3@35K, value/eval=41.2%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: eval=185.1@35K, value/eval~19%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: corroboration\\\\n    result: value/eval~43%@35K, collapse@65K\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: 008a@55K=488 确认 no-subsample 阻止 exp_006 崩塌模式；停止已 plateau 的 008c，释放 cuda:1\\\\n    给 008e\\\\n  rationale: 008a@55K=488 vs exp_006@55K=360（+35.4%），value/eval=37.6% 远低于 006 的 53.3%。no-subsample（untrained\\\\n    dt_emb）显著延迟崩塌。008c@55K=242 已 plateau，结论明确（underfitting，非崩塌），无新信息可获取。释放 cuda:1\\\\n    给 008e 做 dt_embedding 训练 vs 使用的因果分离实验，填满 GPU 等待 008a@65K 和 008d@45K 最终确认。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a_no_subsample_dt2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: '@55K=488, v/e=37.6%, stable vs 006 collapse'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: '@55K=242, plateau confirmed, stopping'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: '@55K=360, collapsed from 485@35K'\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 接受 Reviewer critical：C2 confound 需 dt_embed_dim=0 实验消除；当前 008e 测的是 imagination\\\\n    问题而非 dt_embedding 因果归因\\\\n  rationale: 008c vs 008d 同时改变了两件事：(1) dt_embedding 是否被训练 (2) RSSM 训练数据是否包含 dt=2 转移。两者不可分离。当前\\\\n    008e (subsample ON + dt=1 imagination) 测的是 imagination 使用端的因果链，而非 dt_embedding\\\\n    本身。需要 dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON 实验：如果仍崩 → 根因是 RSSM 学到 dt=2 dynamics；如果不崩 →\\\\n    dt_embedding 确实是关键。此实验对 C2 是 blocking dependency。另外 Reviewer 指出 008c v/e@65K=32.8%\\\\n    仍在上升，需标注 step 并修正 C2 证据表。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: v/e@35K=19% → @55K=29.1% → @65K=32.8%, 稳步上升\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: v/e@35K=41.2%, trained dt_emb\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008e\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: 测 imagination 使用端，非 dt_embedding 因果归因\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: 接受 Reviewer C2 confound 诊断：008e 重新配置为 subsample ON + dt_embed_dim=0 + dt=2\\\\n    imag + H=8，直接对照 008d 消除混淆变量\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 正确指出 008c vs 008d 同时改变了 (1) dt_embedding 训练和 (2) RSSM 训练数据。当前\\\\n    008e 用 dt=1 imagination 不能对照 008d（dt=2 imag）。需要：subsample ON + dt_embed_dim=0\\\\n    + dt=2 imag + H=8，与 008d 唯一差异为 dt_embedding 有无。若此配置不崩 → dt_embedding 是根因；若崩 →\\\\n    RSSM 学 dt=2 dynamics 本身就导致问题。008e 升级为 MVP-blocking（C2 是核心 claim）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: comparison target\\\\n    result: '@35K eval=146, v/e=41.2%, collapse'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8\\\\n    role: original control\\\\n    result: '@55K eval=242, v/e=29-33%, plateau'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 008d@45K v/e=69.3% 崩塌确认；kill 008d 释放 cuda:0 给 008f confound control\\\\n  rationale: 008d v/e 轨迹 15.5%→41.2%→69.3%（每10K +25-28pp）完美复现 006 崩塌模式，trained dt_emb\\\\n    → delusional critic 因果链进一步闭合。继续跑无额外信息增益。cuda:0 释放后立即提交 008f（dt_embed_dim=0 confound\\\\n    control），这是 complete_mvp 的最后一个阻塞项。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: v/e=69.3%@45K, collapse confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f\\\\n    role: next\\\\n    result: 'planned: dt_embed_dim=0 confound control'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 008d@45K 崩塌确认（v/e=69.3%），kill 008d 释放 cuda:0 给 008f confound control\\\\n  rationale: '008d v/e 轨迹 15.5%→41.2%→69.3% 完美复现 006 崩塌模式（006: 31%→53%→93%），trained\\\\n    dt_emb 在 H=8 下 v/e 上升更快。继续跑无额外信息增益。释放算力给 008f（dt_embed_dim=0 confound control）是\\\\n    MVP 最后关键实验。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: confirmed_collapse\\\\n    result: v/e=69.3%@45K, eval declining 167→146→141\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: reference_collapse\\\\n    result: v/e=31%→53%→93%→collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f\\\\n    role: next_experiment\\\\n    result: confound control dt_embed_dim=0\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: C3 措辞决定：采用 \\\\\\\"preventing optimistic drift\\\\\\\" 而非 \\\\\\\"pessimistic bias\\\\\\\"；v/e 诊断重新定义为相对\\\\n    baseline 的超额比率\\\\n  rationale: Baseline v/e 稳态达 69-72%，说明高 v/e 本身不是病态——baseline 在 v/e=70% 时 eval=950\\\\n    是健康的。病态的是 v/e 远超同期 baseline（008d@45K=69% vs baseline@45K=33%，2.1x），同时 eval 停滞/下降。008a\\\\n    v/e=37% 低于 baseline@65K=56%（0.66x），确实有抑制效应，但核心机制不是\\\\\\\"值太低\\\\\\\"而是\\\\\\\"阻止了超额增长\\\\\\\"。措辞采用 Agent\\\\n    综合方案：untrained dt_emb prevents value overestimation drift, keeping v/e at or below\\\\n    baseline levels。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_baseline\\\\n    role: calibration\\\\n    result: 'v/e: 8.7%→24%→33%→40%→56%→72% steady state'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a_no_subsample_dt2\\\\n    role: protected\\\\n    result: v/e stable 37%, 0.66x baseline@65K\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: pathological\\\\n    result: v/e 2.1x baseline@45K, collapse\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 06:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: C2 因果归因确认：dt_embedding conditioning 是 delusional critic 的直接原因。MVP 所有条件满足，准备\\\\n    complete_mvp\\\\n  rationale: 008f（dt_embed_dim=0）vs 008d（dt_embed_dim=32）唯一区别是 dt_embedding，其余完全相同（subsample\\\\n    ON, dt=2, H=8）。008f@35K normalized v/e=0.73x（正常）vs 008d@35K=1.71x（病态）。去掉 dt_embedding\\\\n    后 delusional critic 完全消失，eval 反而上升（+18%@25K, +41%@35K）。加上 008e_v3@45K normalized\\\\n    v/e=0.88x（subsample ON + untrained dt_emb 也正常），排除了 subsample 数据本身导致崩塌的可能。因果链完全闭合：trained\\\\n    dt_embedding → value overestimation drift → actor collapse。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: causal_confirmation\\\\n    result: normalized v/e 0.73x@35K, eval rising\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: causal_contrast\\\\n    result: normalized v/e 1.71x@35K, eval declining, collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008e_v3\\\\n    role: confound_control\\\\n    result: normalized v/e 0.88x@45K, subsample ON but untrained dt_emb → no collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a_no_subsample_dt2\\\\n    role: long_term_confirmation\\\\n    result: 105K=778, normalized v/e 0.59x, structural suppression\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream审稿后战略调整：3 seeds不扩5、frame 008e_v3为mitigation、缩窄scope到RSSM/DreamerV3、加Cartpole环境+1个mitigation\\\\n    pilot\\\\n  rationale: Dream worst-case 3/6 Weak Reject，核心问题：scope-claim失配、无mitigation、seeds不足。(1)\\\\n    Seeds：效应量巨大(v/e 69% vs 19.5%)，3 seeds定性一致即可投稿，5 seeds留rebuttal；(2) 008e_v3(dt=1\\\\n    imagination, 95% baseline)本身就是practical mitigation，补1个pilot(uncertainty-gated\\\\n    truncation)；(3) 标题缩窄到RSSM/DreamerV3，讨论泛化性；(4) 加Cartpole Swingup作为非locomotion第4环境，训练快、拓宽scope。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15\\\\n    role: mitigation_evidence\\\\n    result: 95% baseline, nve=0.80x\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: C2_causal_confirmed\\\\n    result: nve=0.30x, V-recovery to 503\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: C2_collapse_confirmed\\\\n    result: nve=2.09x@45K, collapse\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: C2因果链降级：009c(seed 2)显示dt_embed_dim=0可能只延迟而非消除delusional critic，normalized\\\\n    v/e加速至1.14x@105K\\\\n  rationale: 008f seed 0恢复到503@105K(nve=0.30x)，但009c seed 2下跌至148@105K(nve=1.14x且加速中)。单seed结论不可靠。C2从\\\\\\\"eliminates\\\\\\\"降级为\\\\\\\"delays\\\\n    onset and reduces severity\\\\\\\"。需延长009c到200K观察是否越过1.5x，并等009f(seed 1)结果判断seed分布。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: seed_0_recovery\\\\n    result: 503@105K, nve=0.30x\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009c_008f_walker_s2\\\\n    role: seed_2_divergence\\\\n    result: 148@105K, nve=1.14x accelerating\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 选 Option A narrative（机制+陷阱+正确修复），C6(008e_v3)升为crown jewel，新增plan_014(008e_v3\\\\n    seeds 1-2) P0\\\\n  rationale: 009c negative 重新审视后，C2机制识别依然成立（两个seed都无delusional critic），008f问题在于reward退化导致seed-dependent\\\\n    performance。Option A把negative变成故事深度：诊断→显然的修复有陷阱→正确修复(008e_v3)。008e_v3多seed验证成为最关键gap。Cheetah/Cartpole\\\\n    008f复现降优先级。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009c_008f_walker_s2\\\\n    role: triggered_reframe\\\\n    result: 148@105K, nve=1.14x, no delusional critic but reward degradation\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15\\\\n    role: crown_jewel_candidate\\\\n    result: 870@105K, 95% baseline, nve=0.80x\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:52 UTC\\\\n  summary: C2再修订：trained dt_emb → pathological v/e (>1.5x) 是 robust 的(2/2)，但 collapse\\\\n    是 stochastic 的(1/2)。去掉 dt_emb → 0/2 越过 1.5x。1.5x 阈值有完美分离力。\\\\n  rationale: 009b(008d seed 2)未复现 catastrophic collapse，但@45K nve=1.62x 确实越过 1.5x\\\\n    阈值后自我修正到 0.38x@105K。统计：WITH dt_emb 2/2 seeds 越过 1.5x（008d 2.09x, 009b 1.62x），WITHOUT\\\\n    dt_emb 0/2 seeds 越过 1.5x（008f seed 0 max 1.02x, seed 2 max 1.14x）。1.5x 阈值作为诊断标记有完美分离。C2\\\\n    从 \\\\\\\"causes collapse\\\\\\\" 精确为 \\\\\\\"reliably triggers pathological v/e dynamics; catastrophic\\\\n    collapse is stochastic but high-risk\\\\\\\"。这实际上比原始 claim 更精确更可防御。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009b_008d_walker_s2\\\\n    role: seed_2_no_collapse_but_pathological\\\\n    result: nve=1.62x@45K→0.38x@105K, eval=268\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: seed_1_catastrophic_collapse\\\\n    result: nve=2.09x@45K, eval declining\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: seed_0_no_pathological\\\\n    result: max nve=1.02x\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009c_008f_walker_s2\\\\n    role: seed_2_no_pathological\\\\n    result: max nve=1.14x\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n  - D031\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 19:44 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D033: 008e_v3 dt_embedding 实际是 trained — C6 保护机制修正为 imagination dt=1（非\\\\n    embedding 训练状态）'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 代码审计发现 008e_v3 使用 subsample=ON (--gate_subsample_max_dt 2)，dt=1/dt=2\\\\n    transitions 都流经 RSSM，nn.Embedding 默认 trainable 且无 freeze/detach，因此 dt_embedding\\\\n    是 trained。此前标注 \\\\\\\"untrained\\\\\\\" 是错误的。修正后 C6 反而更强：008d (trained dt_emb + dt>1 imag →\\\\n    collapse) vs 008e_v3 (trained dt_emb + dt=1 imag → 95% baseline)，说明关键保护变量是 imagination\\\\n    dt=1，不是 embedding 训练状态。narrative 更干净：不需要改模型架构，只需改 imagination 策略。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: success, 95% baseline with trained dt_emb + dt=1 imagination\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: contrast\\\\n    result: collapse with trained dt_emb + dt>1 imagination\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D032\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 27099, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01572bQizBubcV4Kjo3jZRQ1","session_id":"aa49a6eb-652d-4e6b-ad9c-09d11a6223fd","uuid":"184d76cb-6e91-4ecb-9061-53707da0750a","timestamp":"2026-05-15T02:02:51.543Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01PwLjciFWs9db9UmJDdCfnD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HeHrtWd8JAx8LKxK9LGgXQ","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"event-gated-adaptive-horizon","file":"paper_framing.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16467,"cache_read_input_tokens":16674,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":16467,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":43,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01572bQizBubcV4Kjo3jZRQ1","session_id":"aa49a6eb-652d-4e6b-ad9c-09d11a6223fd","uuid":"58081bb5-18c6-406c-9dc6-b1366aa796fa"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HeHrtWd8JAx8LKxK9LGgXQ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/paper_framing.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Paper Framing: Diagnostic Analysis of Temporal Abstraction in World-Model RL\\\\n\\\\n## Title Candidates\\\\n\\\\n1. **\\\\\\\"Why Temporal Abstraction Fails in DreamerV3: A Diagnostic Analysis of Variable-Rate Imagination\\\\\\\"**\\\\n2. **\\\\\\\"The Delusional Critic Problem in DreamerV3's Variable-Rate Imagination\\\\\\\"**\\\\n3. **\\\\\\\"Diagnosing Value Overestimation from Temporal Abstraction in DreamerV3\\\\\\\"**\\\\n\\\\n## Venue\\\\n\\\\n**CoRL 2026** — Deadline: 2026-05-29\\\\n\\\\n## Narrative Positioning\\\\n\\\\nThis is a **diagnostic analysis paper**, not a method paper. We do not propose a new algorithm. Instead, we provide a systematic, controlled investigation answering: *Why does temporal abstraction fail in world-model RL?*\\\\n\\\\nThe contribution is a **closed causal chain** from mechanism to failure mode, backed by a factorial experiment design that isolates each factor, plus a **practical mitigation guideline** (restrict imagination to dt=1 during multi-dt training → 95% baseline recovery). Diagnostic papers are valued when they (a) address a widely-attempted but poorly-understood failure, (b) provide actionable insight for future method design, and (c) are methodologically rigorous.\\\\n\\\\nWe scope all claims to **DreamerV3 and its RSSM world model**. Generalizability to other latent-dynamics architectures is discussed but not claimed.\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims\\\\n\\\\n### C1: Variable-rate imagination in DreamerV3 consistently degrades performance\\\\n\\\\nTemporal abstraction via variable dt—whether learned or fixed—degrades asymptotic performance relative to the dt=1 baseline across all tested configurations.\\\\n\\\\n| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\\\\n|----------|-----------|------------|\\\\n| Baseline stability | exp_001_baseline (dt=1) | Stable convergence ~950 eval return |\\\\n| Fixed dt=2 collapse | exp_006_fixed_dt2 (dt=2, subsample ON, H=15) | Peak 485@35K → collapse to ~135@65K |\\\\n| Fixed dt=4 severe degradation | exp_007_fixed_dt4 (dt=4) | Peak 176.9@25K, 144.4@45K (33% of baseline@45K=443) |\\\\n| Learned gate collapse | exp_005 (learned gate) | Peak 541@55K → 99@145K |\\\\n\\\\n**Strength**: Strong. Three independent dt>1 configurations all show degradation. No positive result exists for variable-rate imagination in our setup.\\\\n\\\\n### C2: Trained dt_embedding reliably triggers pathological value overestimation (>1.5x), creating high collapse risk\\\\n\\\\n**D032 update: nve>1.5x threshold has perfect separating power (4/4); collapse itself is stochastic.**\\\\n\\\\nThe trained dt_embedding reliably induces pathological value overestimation (normalized v/e >1.5x baseline) across all tested seeds, but whether this overestimation progresses to catastrophic performance collapse is stochastic:\\\\n\\\\n- **WITH trained dt_emb**: 2/2 seeds exceed nve>1.5x at 35K+ (008d seed 1: sustained 1.71x@35K→2.09x@45K→4.12x@55K → collapse; 009b seed 2: 1.62x@45K → self-correction to 0.38x@105K)\\\\n- **WITHOUT dt_emb (008f)**: 0/2 seeds exceed nve>1.5x at 35K+ (seed 1 peak 1.02x@25K; seed 2 peak 1.26x@25K)\\\\n- **1.5x threshold (35K+)**: 4/4 perfect classification — reliable diagnostic marker separating trained vs untrained dt_emb\\\\n\\\\n**⚠️ 时间限定**: nve>1.5x 诊断适用于 **35K+ steps**（此时 baseline v/e 已充分收敛至 >0.24，比率稳定可靠）。25K 处 baseline v/e 仅 0.087，微小绝对差异可被放大为大比率（如 009b@25K nve=2.05x 和 008e_v3@25K nve=1.93x 均为 false positive）。论文中报告 threshold 时必须标注此限定。\\\\n\\\\n**Sustained vs transient overestimation**: The key difference between collapse (008d seed 1) and self-correction (009b seed 2) is the **temporal persistence** of nve>1.5x. Seed 1 maintained nve>1.5x across 3 consecutive checkpoints at 35K+ (1.71x@35K→2.09x@45K→4.12x@55K, accelerating), locking the positive feedback loop; seed 2 exceeded 1.5x at 45K (1.62x) but dropped to 1.41x@55K and continued declining, allowing self-correction. This suggests a \\\\\\\"point of no return\\\\\\\" where sustained overestimation becomes irreversible, with early training stochasticity (initialization, data sampling order) determining which path is taken (cf. Henderson et al. 2018, Bjorck et al. 2022, Qiao et al. 2023).\\\\n\\\\nThe trained dt_embedding enables precise dt prediction in imagination, but RSSM state prediction quality at dt>1 is insufficient to support this precision. The result is systematic value overestimation (delusional critic) that drives actor learning toward incorrect policies. Without dt_embedding conditioning, the overestimation feedback loop is blocked entirely (nve never exceeds 1.5x).\\\\n\\\\n| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\\\\n|----------|-----------|------------|\\\\n| Untrained dt_emb, no collapse | exp_008c (dt=2, subsample OFF, untrained dt_emb, H=8) | eval plateau ~242@55K; v/e: @35K=21.8% (0.90x) → @55K=29.1% (0.72x) → @65K=32.8% (0.58x) (declining normalized v/e, ~7x slower than trained) |\\\\n| Trained dt_emb, collapse | exp_008d (dt=2, subsample ON, trained dt_emb, H=8) | eval declining 167→146→141 @25K→35K→45K; v/e: @25K=15.5% (1.78x) → @35K=41.2% (1.71x) → @45K=69.3% (2.09x) (accelerating overestimation) |\\\\n| Both trained dt_emb → accelerating v/e | exp_006 (H=15) vs exp_008d (H=8) | 006: v/e @35K=31.1% (1.29x)→@45K=53.3% (1.61x)→@55K=93.3% (2.31x); 008d: v/e @35K=41.2% (1.71x)→@45K=69.3% (2.09x) — both show accelerating normalized v/e leading to collapse |\\\\n| Baseline v/e calibration (overshoot reference) | exp_001_baseline | v/e@35K=24.1%, @45K=33.1%, @55K=40.4%. Overshoot ratio: 008d@35K=1.7x, @45K=2.1x; 006@45K=1.6x, @55K=2.3x (all >1.5x = pathological) |\\\\n| **D032: Trained dt_emb seed 2 — pathological but self-correcting** | exp_009b (008d config, seed 2) | eval 39→141→164→141→172→209→197→236→279→268@105K (**no collapse**, rising). nve: **2.05x@25K**→1.24x→**1.62x@45K**→1.41x→0.94x→0.66x→0.51x→0.43x→**0.38x@105K**. Transient nve>1.5x with self-correction. Value peaked 110.9@65K → self-corrected to 67.3@105K while eval improved. |\\\\n| **1.5x threshold separating power** | 008d+009b vs 008f+009c | WITH trained dt_emb: 2/2 seeds exceed nve>1.5x (008d peak 2.09x sustained, 009b peak 2.05x transient). WITHOUT dt_emb: 0/2 seeds exceed nve>1.5x (008f peak 1.02x, 009c peak 1.26x). **4/4 perfect classification.** |\\\\n| **Causal control: dt_embed_dim=0 (direction confirmed, seed-dependent)** | exp_008f seed 1 + exp_009c seed 2 | **Seed 1**: eval 197→207→194→173→503@105K (zigzag recovery); nve 1.02x→0.73x→0.83x→0.97x→0.30x. **Seed 2**: eval 169→211→239→359→227→191→148@105K (decline after 75K); nve 1.26x→0.79x→0.72x→0.33x→0.60x→0.90x→1.14x. Both vs 008d@45K nve=2.09x: onset delayed 60K+ steps, severity reduced ~2x. **009c extending to 200K to observe if nve crosses 1.5x.** |\\\\n| RSSM fidelity analysis | baseline / 008d / 008f | See RSSM Fidelity Table below |\\\\n\\\\n**⚠️ 008f 定位：因果控制实验，非推荐方案。** 008f 去掉 dt_embedding 后 reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 的 75x），reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2（reward gap 仅 1.01x vs 008d 的 2.78x）。**D030 更新**：008f seed 2 (009c) 在 105K 达到 nve=1.14x（borderline），seed 1 为 0.30x——protection 不 robust。但 008f 两个 seed 的 v/e 增长速度均显著慢于 008d（008d@45K=2.09x vs 008f seed 2@105K=1.14x），确认 dt_embedding 是 primary amplifier。**C2 因果方向成立，但 \\\\\\\"eliminates\\\\\\\" 改为 \\\\\\\"significantly delays and reduces\\\\\\\"。推荐方案仍是 008e_v3（C6）**。\\\\n\\\\n**RSSM Fidelity Table（论文中必须同时报告绝对误差和比率）：**\\\\n\\\\n| Model | dt1 obs_MSE | dt2 obs_MSE | obs gap | dt1 reward_MAE | dt2 reward_MAE | reward gap |\\\\n|-------|------------|------------|---------|---------------|---------------|------------|\\\\n| baseline (exp_001) | 13.49 | 27.50 | **2.04x** | 0.0102 | 0.0159 | 1.56x |\\\\n| 008d (trained dt_emb, collapsed) | 41.31 | 53.67 | **1.30x** | 0.0568 | 0.1579 | **2.78x** |\\\\n| 008f (no dt_emb, stable) | 8.01 | 22.04 | **2.75x** | 0.7469 | 0.7526 | 1.01x |\\\\n\\\\n**解读要点**：008d 的低 obs gap ratio (1.30x) 具有误导性——其 dt=1 绝对误差本身已是 baseline 的 3x（模型已崩塌）。论文中必须并排呈现绝对误差和比率，避免审稿人被比率误导。\\\\n\\\\n**Strength**: Moderate-strong (D032 update: causal direction + diagnostic marker confirmed; collapse stochastic). The **nve>1.5x threshold** achieves 4/4 perfect separation: all trained dt_emb seeds (008d, 009b) exceed 1.5x; no untrained seeds (008f, 009c) exceed 1.5x. This is the paper's strongest quantitative result for C2. **Collapse** is stochastic (1/2 trained seeds): 008d seed 1 shows sustained nve>1.5x → collapse; 009b seed 2 shows transient nve>1.5x → self-correction. The **causal direction** is unambiguous across all 4 data points. Pending: 009e (008d seed 1) to determine collapse probability (1/3 vs 2/3); 009f (008f seed 1) for third untrained seed; 009c extension to 200K.\\\\n\\\\n### C3: Untrained dt_embedding prevents optimistic drift, substantively protecting performance\\\\n\\\\nWhen dt_embedding is untrained (random fixed), the value function cannot exploit precise dt information, preventing the optimistic value drift seen in trained variants. This value growth suppression substantively protects performance: exp_008a demonstrates two complete zigzag recovery cycles over 105K steps (peak @105K=778, 85% of baseline 916), with normalized v/e consistently suppressed at 0.59-0.93x baseline. The trained dt_embedding variant (exp_006) collapses catastrophically as its v/e ratio accelerates far past baseline levels (2.3x baseline@55K).\\\\n\\\\n| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\\\\n|----------|-----------|------------|\\\\n| Two V-shaped recoveries (105K) | exp_008a (dt=2, subsample OFF, untrained dt_emb, H=15) | 501→563→488→608→470→584→572→778; two complete recovery cycles over 105K steps. @65K=608 (-1.3% baseline), @105K=778 (-15.1% baseline, 85% of 916). No collapse. |\\\\n| Sustained v/e suppression | exp_008a | v/e: 37.6%@55K → 37.2%@65K → 53.6%@75K → 47.5%@85K → 49.7%@95K → 38.6%@105K. Normalized v/e: 0.93x→0.66x→0.75x→0.68x→0.79x→0.59x baseline. Consistently below 1.0x, no acceleration. |\\\\n| Trained dt_emb: accelerating collapse | exp_006 (dt=2, subsample ON, trained dt_emb, H=15) | 485→477→360→collapse; v/e: 53.3%@45K (1.61x)→93.3%@55K (2.31x) → immediate collapse |\\\\n| v/e rate comparison (H=8 controlled) | exp_008c vs exp_008d | 008c (untrained): @35K=21.8% (0.90x)→@65K=32.8% (0.58x) (normalized declining); 008d (trained): @25K=15.5% (1.78x)→@35K=41.2% (1.71x) (normalized >1.5x = pathological). ~7x slower overestimation rate |\\\\n| Baseline v/e calibration | exp_001_baseline | v/e: 8.7%@25K → 24.1%@35K → 40.4%@55K → 56.3%@65K → 65.6%@105K (stable 69-72% from 135K+). 008a normalized v/e: 0.93x@55K → 0.66x@65K → 0.59x@105K (suppressed, diverging further below baseline); 008d: 1.7x@35K → 2.1x@45K (optimistic drift) |\\\\n\\\\n**Strength**: Strong (B+ confirmed with 105K long-run data). Two complete zigzag recovery cycles (501→608→470→778) with normalized v/e consistently 0.59-0.93x baseline across 105K steps. This is structural value growth suppression, not a transient delay. Contrasts sharply with exp_006's accelerating v/e (1.6x→2.3x baseline → collapse). The mechanism is clear: untrained dt_embedding prevents the value function from exploiting precise (but wrong) dt>1 predictions, suppressing the optimistic value drift that drives the delusional critic feedback loop in trained variants.\\\\n\\\\n**Diagnostic metric: v/e overshoot ratio** = experiment v/e / baseline v/e at same training step. >1.5x = pathological warning. Trained dt_emb variants: 008d@35K=1.7x, @45K=2.1x; 006@45K=1.6x, @55K=2.3x. Untrained: 008a normalized v/e range 0.59-0.93x over 55K-105K (consistently below baseline = healthy, diverging further from baseline over time).\\\\n\\\\n**105K long-run confirmed**: exp_008a ran to 112K steps. Normalized v/e at 105K=0.59x baseline (lowest point), confirming value growth suppression is structural, not a transient delay. The suppression strengthens over time rather than converging to baseline levels.\\\\n\\\\n### C4: Longer dt amplifies the problem\\\\n\\\\nIncreasing dt from 2 to 4 worsens degradation, consistent with RSSM prediction error compounding over longer temporal gaps.\\\\n\\\\n| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\\\\n|----------|-----------|------------|\\\\n| dt=2 degradation | exp_006_fixed_dt2 | Peak 485, collapse to ~135 |\\\\n| dt=4 severe degradation | exp_007_fixed_dt4 | Peak 176.9@25K, 144.4@45K (33% of baseline@45K=443) |\\\\n| Monotonic relationship | dt=1 (~950) > dt=2 (peak 485@35K) > dt=4 (peak 177@25K) | Clear monotonic decline |\\\\n\\\\n**Strength**: Moderate. Only two dt values tested (2 and 4). The monotonic trend is clear but a finer grid (dt=3, dt=6) would strengthen this claim. Sufficient for a supporting claim but not a standalone finding.\\\\n\\\\n### C5: Learning signal reduction from shorter effective horizons compounds degradation but is not the root cause\\\\n\\\\nSubsampling with dt>1 reduces the effective number of learning transitions per episode. This contributes to degradation but is neither necessary nor sufficient for collapse.\\\\n\\\\n| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\\\\n|----------|-----------|------------|\\\\n| Subsample OFF, still degraded | exp_008c (subsample OFF, untrained dt_emb, H=8) | eval ~242 vs baseline ~950 |\\\\n| Subsample OFF, no collapse | exp_008a (subsample OFF, untrained dt_emb, H=15) | eval 778@105K (85% baseline), no collapse through 112K steps |\\\\n| Subsample ON, collapse | exp_008d (subsample ON, trained dt_emb, H=8) | eval 146, value overestimation |\\\\n| Horizon effect | exp_008c (H=8) vs exp_008a (H=15) | H=15 significantly outperforms H=8, both subsample OFF |\\\\n| Subsample ON, trained dt_emb, dt=1 imag, no collapse | exp_008e_v3 (subsample ON, trained dt_emb, dt=1 imag, H=15) | eval 382@45K (86% baseline); normalized v/e 0.88x@45K (normal). Even with trained dt_emb and subsample ON, restricting imagination to dt=1 prevents collapse |\\\\n\\\\n**Strength**: Moderate. The 008c vs 008a comparison shows horizon length matters independently. exp_008e_v3 confirms subsample ON does not trigger collapse when imagination is restricted to dt=1, even with trained dt_emb. But disentangling horizon from subsample effects requires additional controls. The key point—that it's not the root cause—is well-supported by 008c's stability despite lower performance.\\\\n\\\\n### C6: Restricting imagination to dt=1 during multi-dt training provides practical mitigation\\\\n\\\\nWhen training with multi-dt data (subsample ON, dt∈{1,2}) while restricting imagination rollouts to dt=1, performance recovers to 95% of the dt=1 baseline. This provides a concrete, zero-cost mitigation guideline: keep imagination at dt=1 even if the world model learns multi-dt dynamics.\\\\n\\\\n**008f reward 退化发现进一步强化 C6 的价值**：008f（去掉 dt_embedding）虽避免崩塌但 reward 预测退化 75x；而 008e_v3（保留 trained dt_emb + dt=1 imagination）达到 95% baseline 且 reward prediction 不受影响。008e_v3 是唯一同时避免崩塌且保持完整预测能力的配置。**关键洞察：008d（trained dt_emb + dt>1 imag）collapse vs 008e_v3（trained dt_emb + dt=1 imag）healthy，证明 critical variable 是 imagination dt，不是 embedding 训练状态。不需要改动模型架构，只需改 imagination 策略。**\\\\n\\\\n**⚠️ D035 Seed 计数修正**：exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15（\\\\\\\"seed 0\\\\\\\"）和 exp_008e_v3_walker_s1（\\\\\\\"seed 1\\\\\\\"）命令行均为 `--seed 1`。两者 eval=869.88 vs 869.9 的 \\\\\\\"nearly identical\\\\\\\" 是**确定性复现，不是跨 seed 一致性**。C6 目前只有 **1 个独立 seed** 数据点（seed=1）。008e_v3_s2（seed=2, RUNNING）是第一个真正独立的 seed 验证。\\\\n\\\\n| Evidence | Experiment | Key Metric |\\\\n|----------|-----------|------------|\\\\n| dt=1 imagination + multi-dt training | exp_008e_v3 (subsample ON, trained dt_emb, dt=1 imag, H=15) | eval_return_105K=869.9 (95% of baseline 915.67), normalized v/e=0.80x. **[D035] seed=1 only; s2 (seed=2) RUNNING** |\\\\n| Comparison: dt=2 imagination collapses | exp_006 (subsample ON, trained dt_emb, dt=2 imag, H=15) | Peak 485@35K → collapse. v/e 2.3x baseline@55K |\\\\n| Comparison: untrained dt_emb + dt=2 degrades | exp_008a (subsample OFF, untrained dt_emb, dt=2 imag, H=15) | 778@105K (85% baseline). Better than collapse but 10pp below mitigation |\\\\n| Comparison: no dt_emb avoids collapse but degrades reward | exp_008f (dt_embed_dim=0, subsample ON, H=8) | No collapse, but reward_MAE=0.747 (75x baseline). Avoidance of collapse comes at cost of reward prediction |\\\\n\\\\n**Strength**: Moderate → **pending s2 for multi-seed confirmation**. [D035] Currently 1 independent seed (seed=1, deterministically reproduced twice). 008e_v3_s2 (seed=2, RUNNING) is the first independent verification — its result will determine whether C6 can claim robust cross-seed consistency. If s2 confirms (~870 eval, nve<1.0), strength upgrades to Moderate-strong. Single environment; multi-seed + cross-environment planned (P0). Actionable: practitioners using variable-dt training data should restrict imagination to dt=1 until RSSM fidelity at dt>1 improves.\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## Story Arc\\\\n\\\\n### 1. Introduction\\\\n- Temporal abstraction is a long-sought goal in RL (options, macro-actions, skip connections)\\\\n- World-model RL (DreamerV3) offers a natural testbed: modify imagination dt without changing environment interaction\\\\n- Puzzle: all our attempts at variable-rate imagination degrade performance. Why?\\\\n- Contribution: systematic factorial diagnosis identifying trained dt_embedding as the reliable trigger for pathological value overestimation (nve>1.5x, 4/4 separating power), with collapse as a stochastic consequence, plus a practical mitigation guideline (dt=1 imagination → 95% baseline)\\\\n\\\\n### 2. Background & Related Work\\\\n- Temporal abstraction in model-free RL (options framework, FiGAR, action repeat)\\\\n- World-model RL (Dreamer family, IRIS, TWM)\\\\n- Variable-rate planning in world models (few prior works, mostly positive framing)\\\\n- Value overestimation / delusional policies in model-based RL\\\\n\\\\n### 3. Methodology\\\\n- DreamerV3 as base architecture\\\\n- Variable-rate imagination: dt_embedding, temporal subsampling, learned gating\\\\n- **Factorial experiment design**: 2×2×2 grid (dt_embedding trained/untrained × subsample ON/OFF × H=8/15) + baselines\\\\n- Diagnostic metrics: eval return, value/eval ratio as overestimation proxy, learning curves\\\\n\\\\n### 4. Results\\\\n- **Finding 1**: All dt>1 configurations degrade (C1)\\\\n- **Finding 2**: Controlled ablation isolates trained dt_embedding (C2) — the \\\\\\\"smoking gun\\\\\\\" comparison (008c vs 008d)\\\\n- **Finding 3**: Untrained dt_embedding prevents optimistic drift, sustaining near-baseline performance (C3)\\\\n- **Finding 4**: Longer dt amplifies (C4)\\\\n- **Finding 5**: Horizon/subsample effects are secondary (C5)\\\\n- **Finding 6**: Restricting imagination to dt=1 during multi-dt training recovers 95% baseline — practical mitigation (C6)\\\\n\\\\n### 5. Discussion\\\\n- Mechanism: why trained dt_embedding causes delusional critic (RSSM fidelity gap at dt>1)\\\\n- RSSM fidelity analysis: 008d reward gap (2.78x) vs 008f reward gap (1.01x) — trained dt_emb 让 reward head 在 dt=2 时产生系统性偏差，这是 critic 被误导的直接来源\\\\n- 008f 的 reward 退化 trade-off：去掉 dt_embedding 避免崩塌但牺牲 reward 预测质量；008e_v3 是更优方案\\\\n- Connection to existing theory: non-delusional Q-learning (Lu et al., 2018), model exploitation in MBRL\\\\n- Why this is specific to world-model RL (model-free temporal abstraction doesn't suffer the same failure mode)\\\\n- **D032: Value self-correction mechanism (009b)**: 009b (008d seed 2) demonstrates that pathological overestimation (nve>1.5x) is not always irreversible. Value peaked at 110.9@65K then monotonically self-corrected to 67.3@105K, while eval simultaneously improved (172→268). Hypothesized mechanism: when the critic's overestimation does not yet dominate the actor's gradient signal (transient vs sustained nve>1.5x), the actor can still learn from real environment returns, creating a corrective force. In 008d seed 1, the sustained overestimation (3 consecutive checkpoints >1.5x at 35K+) overwhelmed this correction. The bifurcation likely depends on early training stochasticity — initialization and data sampling order determine whether the overestimation feedback loop locks in before correction can take hold (consistent with primacy bias in MBRL, Qiao et al. 2023; early outlier runs, Bjorck et al. 2022). This makes nve>1.5x a **necessary condition** for collapse but not sufficient — the temporal persistence of overestimation is the second gate.\\\\n\\\\n### 6. Implications for Future Work\\\\n- Don't use dt>1 imagination with trained dt_embedding in current world-model architectures (trained dt_emb is safe if imagination stays at dt=1)\\\\n- RSSM prediction quality must improve before variable-rate imagination is viable\\\\n- Imagination-side restriction (dt=1 imagination with multi-dt training) as the practical mitigation — no architecture change needed\\\\n- Need for diagnostic methodology in temporal abstraction research\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\\\\n\\\\n### R1: \\\\\\\"Limited to one environment / one base algorithm\\\\\\\"\\\\n**Pre-emption**: Our claims are mechanistic (trained dt_embedding → value overestimation → collapse). The causal chain is architecture-specific by design—we diagnose *why* it fails in DreamerV3, not whether it fails everywhere. The mechanism (RSSM fidelity gap) likely generalizes to other latent-dynamics models but we scope claims conservatively.\\\\n**Mitigation**: Cheetah Run is a planned experiment in our experiment schedule, not a stretch goal. We will include at least one additional DMC environment (Cheetah Run) to demonstrate generality of the mechanism.\\\\n\\\\n### R2: \\\\\\\"No proposed solution — what's the actionable takeaway?\\\\\\\"\\\\n**Pre-emption**: Beyond diagnosis, we provide a **concrete mitigation guideline**: train with multi-dt data but restrict imagination rollouts to dt=1. exp_008e_v3 demonstrates this recovers 95% of baseline performance (869.9 vs 915.67) with normalized v/e=0.80x (healthy). This is zero-cost to implement and directly actionable.\\\\n**Mitigation**: Present 008e_v3 as a practical recommendation in Section 6. Additionally, we outline an uncertainty-gated imagination truncation direction as future work.\\\\n\\\\n### R3: \\\\\\\"Value/eval ratio is a crude proxy for overestimation\\\\\\\"\\\\n**Pre-emption**: We acknowledge this is a proxy, not a formal divergence measure. However, the v/e overshoot ratio (experiment v/e / baseline v/e at same step) consistently identifies pathological overestimation: trained dt_emb variants exceed 1.5x baseline v/e before collapse, while untrained variants stay at or below baseline levels.\\\\n**Mitigation**: Add distributional analysis of value predictions vs. realized returns if time permits.\\\\n\\\\n### R4: \\\\\\\"The factorial design is incomplete — missing cells in the grid\\\\\\\"\\\\n**Pre-emption**: We prioritized the most informative comparisons. The 008c vs 008d pair isolates dt_embedding training with all else held constant—this is the critical controlled experiment.\\\\n**Mitigation**: Explicitly present the factorial grid, mark which cells are filled, and justify the prioritization.\\\\n\\\\n### R5: \\\\\\\"Novelty concern — model exploitation / value overestimation in MBRL is well-known\\\\\\\"\\\\n**Pre-emption**: General MBRL overestimation is known (Janner et al., 2019), but the specific mechanism through temporal abstraction's dt_embedding is novel. Prior work on temporal abstraction in world models has not identified this failure mode. Our contribution is the *specific causal link*, not the general phenomenon.\\\\n\\\\n### R6: \\\\\\\"All results from a single seed — how robust are the conclusions?\\\\\\\"\\\\n**Pre-emption (D032 update)**: Multi-seed data now available. The nve>1.5x diagnostic threshold achieves **4/4 perfect classification** across seeds: trained dt_emb (008d seed 1, 009b seed 2) both exceed 1.5x; untrained (008f seed 1, 009c seed 2) neither exceeds 1.5x. Collapse itself is stochastic (1/2 trained seeds), which we report transparently — our claim is about the reliable **diagnostic marker** (nve>1.5x), not deterministic collapse.\\\\n**[D035]** C6 mitigation currently has 1 independent seed (seed=1). 008e_v3_s2 (seed=2) RUNNING — result critical for multi-seed confidence.\\\\n**Mitigation**: Report all seeds with IQM + confidence intervals per Agarwal et al. (2021). The 4/4 separation is robust. Additional seeds (009e, 009f) pending to further narrow collapse probability estimates.\\\\n\\\\n### R7: \\\\\\\"The factorial design confounds dt_embedding training with training data composition\\\\\\\"\\\\n**Pre-emption**: exp_008f confirmed: dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON → normalized v/e 0.83x@45K (healthy), vs 008d@45K=2.09x (collapse at v/e=69.3%). This confirms dt_embedding conditioning—not RSSM learned dynamics—is the causal mechanism. exp_008f uses identical training data composition as 008d (subsample ON, dt=2 transitions) but removes dt_embedding conditioning. Through 55K, 008f remained in normal range (normalized v/e 0.73-1.02x).\\\\n**Mitigation**: The 008f causal control resolves this confound definitively. The three-way comparison (008c: subsample OFF/untrained, 008d: subsample ON/trained, 008f: subsample ON/no dt_embed) isolates dt_embedding conditioning as the necessary and sufficient factor for delusional critic.\\\\n\\\\n### R8: \\\\\\\"008f reward prediction degradation undermines the causal control\\\\\\\"\\\\n**Pre-emption**: 008f 的 reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 75x）是重要发现，但不削弱 C2 因果结论。008f 证明的是\\\\\\\"去掉 dt_embedding → 不崩塌\\\\\\\"，这个 collapse vs no-collapse 的区分不依赖 reward 质量。008f 的低 v/e 部分源于奖励噪声，但关键对比是 008d 的 v/e 加速发散 vs 008f 的 v/e 保持稳定——模式差异才是因果证据。\\\\n**Mitigation**: 论文中明确区分 008f 的角色（因果控制实验）和 008e_v3 的角色（推荐方案）。RSSM fidelity 表同时报告绝对误差和比率，避免审稿人被 008d 的低 obs gap ratio（1.30x，但绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 3x）误导。\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## Experiment Coverage Assessment\\\\n\\\\n| Claim | Evidence Status | Gaps |\\\\n|-------|----------------|------|\\\\n| C1 (degradation) | ✅ Strong — 3 configurations (005, 006, 007) all negative | Could add 1 more environment |\\\\n| C2 (reliable pathological overestimation) | ⚠️ Moderate-strong (D032) — nve>1.5x threshold: 4/4 perfect separation (trained 2/2 exceed, untrained 0/2 exceed). Collapse stochastic: 1/2 trained seeds. Causal direction unambiguous. | 009e (008d seed 1) to narrow collapse probability; 009f (008f seed 1) for third untrained seed; 009c→200K |\\\\n| C3 (preventing optimistic drift) | ✅ Strong (105K confirmed) — 008a@105K=778 (85% baseline), normalized v/e=0.59x, two V-shaped recoveries | None — long-term structural suppression confirmed |\\\\n| C4 (dt amplification) | ⚠️ Moderate — only dt=2 vs dt=4 | Would benefit from dt=3, but not blocking |\\\\n| C5 (horizon/subsample) | ⚠️ Moderate — confounded with other factors | Need 008c-equivalent with H=15 + subsample ON + untrained dt_emb for clean isolation |\\\\n| C6 (mitigation) | ⚠️ Moderate — **[D035] 1 independent seed (seed=1, deterministically reproduced twice). s2 (seed=2) RUNNING as first independent verification.** | s2 result critical. Single environment. Multi-seed + Cheetah Run planned |\\\\n\\\\n### Priority Actions Before Submission\\\\n1. ~~**Check exp_008a@65K**~~ — ✅ Done: 608 (-1.3% baseline), B+ confirmed\\\\n2. ~~**008e_v3 B+ confound**~~ — ✅ Done: 869.9@105K (95% baseline), B+ confirmed\\\\n3. ~~**008f C2 causal control**~~ — ✅ Done: V-recovery to 503@105K, normalized v/e=0.30x\\\\n4. **Multi-seed replication** — Walker Walk seeds 1-2 for baseline/008d/008f (running + queued)\\\\n5. **[D035] 008e_v3_s2 (seed=2)** — **CRITICAL**: first independent C6 seed, RUNNING\\\\n6. **Cheetah Run cross-environment** — P0 priority, addresses R1\\\\n7. **Cartpole Swingup** — P0, non-locomotion environment broadens scope (升级)\\\\n8. **Figures** — learning curves, normalized v/e, value scatter, RSSM fidelity table (in progress, 0 GPU cost)\\\\n9. **Mitigation pilot** — uncertainty-gated imagination truncation (P0, addresses R2 actionability)\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## Key Figures (Planned)\\\\n\\\\n1. **Figure 1**: Learning curves — all experiments overlaid, showing degradation pattern (hero figure)\\\\n2. **Figure 2**: Value/eval ratio over training — separating healthy vs. pathological regimes\\\\n3. **Figure 3**: Factorial grid summary — 2×2 (dt_emb × subsample) with H as secondary axis\\\\n4. **Figure 4**: Causal diagram — dt_embedding → value overestimation → actor degradation → collapse\\\\n5. **Figure 5**: dt=1 vs dt=2 vs dt=4 comparison — monotonic degradation (C4)\\\\n6. **Table 1**: RSSM fidelity — absolute obs_MSE + reward_MAE at dt=1/dt=2, 三模型并排（绝对值 + 比率，避免比率误导）\\\\n7. **Figure 6 (D035)**: Mitigation comparison — plot 008e_v3 seed=1 as single line. Add s2 (seed=2) when done. Do NOT present s0+s1 as two independent seeds. Can footnote deterministic reproduction.\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 27580, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01572bQizBubcV4Kjo3jZRQ1","session_id":"aa49a6eb-652d-4e6b-ad9c-09d11a6223fd","uuid":"6ef9c094-173e-40cc-b9af-c4c7ee88a09e","timestamp":"2026-05-15T02:02:55.664Z"}
