{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GRHvSQFmtAo3eHWpEx3iZy","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-15\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| exp_008e_v3_walker_s2 | Walker Walk trained dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=1 imag + H=15 seed 2 — crown jewel C6 seed 2 验证 | — | — | — |\\\\n| exp_009a_baseline_walker_s2 | Walker Walk baseline seed 2 — 多 seed 复现 exp_001 baseline，建立 v/e 校准参考（plan_010） | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp_009d_baseline_walker_s1: Walker Walk baseline seed 1 — 多 seed 复现 exp_001 baseline，建立 v/e 校准参考（plan_010）（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n- exp_009e_008d_walker_s1: Walker Walk trained dt_emb + subsample ON + H=8 seed 1 — 多 seed 复现 008d delusional critic collapse，巩固 C2 统计显著性（plan_011）（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n- exp_010a_cheetah_baseline_s1: Cheetah Run baseline seed 1 — 建立第二环境 dt=1 参考基线，为跨环境验证 C1/C2 做准备（plan_020）（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n- exp_009f_008f_walker_s1: Walker Walk dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON + H=8 seed 1 — 多 seed 复现 008f 因果控制稳定性，巩固 C2 统计显著性（plan_012）（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp_008e_v3_walker_s1** (success): Walker Walk trained dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=1 imag + H=15 seed 1 — crown jewel C6 验证：trained dt_emb 在 dt=1 imagination 下不触发 delusional critic（plan_014） ← 基于 exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15\\\\n- **exp_006** (killed): —\\\\n  [exp_006_full_metrics](/api/workspace-files/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/exp_006/report/exp_006_full_metrics.md)\\\\n- **exp_008a** (killed): —\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 6 / 负向 9 / 失败 1 / 共 23\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nbjb1-45299: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- exp_002_event_gated: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_006: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008a: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008c: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008d: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008e_subsample_on_fixed_dt1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008e_subsample_on_dt1_h15: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008e_v2_subsample_on_dt1_h15: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1771, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01ULYQdJC4FEnAQtNq7j8RxB","session_id":"aa49a6eb-652d-4e6b-ad9c-09d11a6223fd","uuid":"4877fc5d-52e8-4738-b87c-5ffe94d1a97c","timestamp":"2026-05-15T02:03:14.509Z"}
